{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50308","headline":"晚秋至临蕃被禁之作 · 佚名","name":"晚秋至临蕃被禁之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一到荒城恨转深，数朝长叹意虽任。\n昔日三军雄镇地，今时百（白）草遍城阴。\n隤墉穷巷无人迹，独树孤坟有鸟吟。\n邂逅流移千里外，谁念恓（原作「栖」）惶一片心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}